platform. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"dg-console\"><div class=\"dg-consoleSay\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Service level objectives</p><h3 class=\"dg-consoleTitle\">The objective, and the month it was missed</h3><p class=\"dg-consoleBody\">Service level objectives are defined with the business and reported with the misses left in. A report with no misses on it over twelve months is a report nobody is reading.</p></div><div class=\"dg-consoleArt\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Service level — Monthly report</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1–31 October 2026</span></span></div><div class=\"product_slaHeadline__W8VHf\"><div class=\"product_slaFigure__TrcDh\"><span class=\"product_slaValue__10xgz u-mo