convergence</span></li><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Planned maintenance</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">20<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Scheduled, announced 10 d ahead — no requests lost</span></li><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Degraded</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">22<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">2 m 51 s — TLS terminator rolling restart</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Report generated <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-11-01 09:00 UTC</span></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Signed off <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">M. Thorne</span>, service delivery</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Next review <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-11-12</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of a monthly service-level report against platform objectives. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"included\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Scope</p><h2 id=\"included\" class=\"sv-h2\">What is included</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Infrastructure as code</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Terraform or equivalent, reproducible from an empty account, with environments that differ by variables rather than by history.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">CI/CD</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Build once, promote the artefact. Short-lived OIDC identity for deployment rather than static keys. Progressive delivery with automated rollback on signal.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Kubernetes and runtime</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Cluster design, workload identity, admission control, autoscaling and cost shaping. Or a deliberate decision not to use Kubernetes, which is often correct.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Observability</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Structured logs, metrics, traces and alerts that page a human only for things a human must do. Service level objectives with an error budget that has consequences.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Secrets and identity</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Vault or cloud-native secret management, automated rotation, and no long-lived credentials in CI. This is the most common finding in our own cloud reviews.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Developer experience</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">One-command local environment, preview environments per pull request, and a path to production an engineer can follow on their first week.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"security-by-default\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The differentiator</p><h2 id=\"security-by-default\" class=\"sv-h2\">Security by default</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Our engineers work next to a security practice that will attack what they build. That changes how authorisation, audit logging and secrets get designed — before the first commit rather than after the first report.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><p class=\"sv-lede\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">We build it and we break it. The findings land in our own sprint backlog.</p><p class=\"sv-cred\"><strong class=\"sv-cred__figure\">9 days median</strong><span class=\"sv-cred__context\">from a security finding being confirmed to the fix being in production, on joint engagements</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>Read Secure SDLC</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"What security by default means on a build\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Threat model at design time — Before the first sprint. The cheapest security finding is an architecture decision, and the most expensive one is the same decision discovered in week forty.</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Secure design review at each decision — Our testers review architectural decision records as they are written, not the finished system.</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Monitoring and retest — Detections written for the system we built, and a retest cadence after launch. The loop does not stop at release.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"methodology\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The Adversary Loop</p><h2 id=\"methodology\" class=\"sv-h2\">How the engagement runs</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Threat models shape the build. The build gets attacked. The attack rewrites the threat model.</p></div><figure class=\"dg\" id=\"engagement-shape\"><svg class=\"dg-gantt\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 252\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Engagement shape for Platform &amp; DevOps: 6 phases. Phase 1, Assess, Weeks 1–2, inside the engagement window. Phase 2, Foundations, Weeks 2–6, inside the engagement window. Phase 3, Pipeline, Weeks 5–10, inside the engagement window, producing the ci/cd pipeline with short-lived identity and automated rollback. Phase 4, Observability, Weeks 8–12, inside the engagement window. Phase 5, Rehearse, Week 12, inside the engagement window. Phase 6, Hand over, Weeks 12–16, inside the engagement window.\"><text class=\"dg-axisUnit\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">weeks from kick-off</text><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"236\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"392.875\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"392.875\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"392.875\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"549.75\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"549.75\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"549.75\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"706.625\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"706.625\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"706.625\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text></g><line class=\"dg-zero\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"dg-zeroLabel\" x=\"236\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\">kick-off</text><text class=\"dg-colHead\" x=\"762\" y=\"16\">Drops out</text><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"65\">01</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"65\">Assess</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"236\" y=\"53.5\" width=\"62.75\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"306.75\" y=\"64\">Weeks 1–2</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"64\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\">02</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"95\">Foundations</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"267.375\" y=\"83.5\" width=\"156.875\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"432.25\" y=\"94\">Weeks 2–6</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"94\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"125\">03</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"125\">Pipeline</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"361.5\" y=\"113.5\" width=\"188.25\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"557.75\" y=\"124\">Weeks 5–10</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"121\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"117\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"124\">CI/CD pipeline with short-liv…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"155\">04</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"155\">Observability</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"455.625\" y=\"143.5\" width=\"156.875\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"620.5\" y=\"154\">Weeks 8–12</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"154\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"185\">05</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"185\">Rehearse</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"581.125\" y=\"173.5\" width=\"31.375\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"620.5\" y=\"184\">Week 12</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"184\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"215\">06</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"215\">Hand over</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"581.125\" y=\"203.5\" width=\"156.875\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"573.125\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\">Weeks 12–16</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"214\">—</text></g></svg><div class=\"dg-ganttText\"><ol class=\"dg-sched\"><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">01</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Assess</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 1–2</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">02</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Foundations</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 2–6</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">03</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Pipeline</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 5–10</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>CI/CD pipeline with short-lived identity and automated rollback</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">04</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Observability</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 8–12</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">05</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Rehearse</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 12</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">06</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Hand over</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 12–16</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li></ol></div><figcaption class=\"dg-cap\"><ul class=\"dg-legend\"><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"before\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Before the window opens</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"window\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Inside the engagement window</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"after\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>After the report — a commitment, not an upsell</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"standing\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Standing work with no fixed window</li></ul><p class=\"dg-capNote\">Every bar is positioned and sized from that phase’s own stated schedule, converted to a single week axis and drawn to one scale. <!-- -->Nothing is rounded to make the picture tidier, and a phase whose schedule the service does not state — standing work, a quarterly cadence, anything open-ended — is drawn as a dotted row carrying its own words rather than handed a plausible-looking bar it never had.</p></figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-phaseStack\"><div class=\"stack\"><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">01 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Assess</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 1–2</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Measure the four delivery metrics, read the pipeline, and find the single points of failure — usually a person, a laptop or a credential.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">02 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Foundations</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 2–6</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Infrastructure as code for one environment, reproducible from empty. Pipeline identity moved to OIDC. Secrets into a vault.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">03 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Pipeline</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 5–10</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Build-once-promote pipeline with environment gates, preview environments, and automated rollback triggered by signal rather than by someone noticing.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">04 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Observability</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 8–12</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Instrument, define service level objectives with the business, and prune the alerts that page without requiring action.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">05 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Rehearse</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 12</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Game day: rehearse rollback, failover and restore-from-backup. A documented procedure that has never been executed is a hypothesis.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">06 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Hand over</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 12–16</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Paired work, runbooks, and an on-call rota your team owns. Then a lighter advisory retainer if wanted.</p></div></article></div></div><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/methodologies\"><span>Read the methodology — How we run an engagement</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"stack\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Technology</p><h2 id=\"stack\" class=\"sv-h2\">The stack</h2></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:var(--s4);align-items:flex-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--accent);flex:none\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg><ul class=\"sv-chips\" aria-label=\"Technology stack\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">Terraform</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">Kubernetes</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">ArgoCD</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">GitHub Actions</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">AWS</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">Azure</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">GCP</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">Prometheus</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">Grafana</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">OpenTelemetry</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">HashiCorp Vault</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"deliverables\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Deliverables</p><h2 id=\"deliverables\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Exactly what lands in your inbox</h2><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Walk a redacted sample before you buy one</a></p><div class=\"sv-deliverableArt\"><figure class=\"dg dg-stackFig\"><svg class=\"dg-stack\" viewBox=\"0 0 531 358\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What lands in your inbox on a Platform &amp; DevOps engagement: 6 deliverables. 1, Infrastructure as code, reproducible from an empty account, in your repository, in your repo. 2, CI/CD pipeline with short-lived identity and automated rollback, written document. 3, Service level objectives with error budgets and alerting that requires action, written document. 4, Game day report covering rollback, failover and restore-from-backup, written report. 5, Runbooks and an on-call rota your team can operate, live session. 6, Delivery metrics dashboard: lead time, deploy frequency, change failure rate, restore time, live register.\"><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"36\" y=\"38\">01</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"472\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"end\">In your repo</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"36\" y=\"56\">Infrastructure as code, reproducible from…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"36\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"472\" y2=\"62\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"41\" y=\"84\">02</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"477\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"41\" y=\"102\">CI/CD pipeline with short-lived identity…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"41\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"108\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"46\" y=\"130\">03</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"482\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"46\" y=\"148\">Service level objectives with error budge…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"46\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"482\" y2=\"154\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"51\" y=\"176\">04</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"487\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written report</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"51\" y=\"194\">Game day report covering rollback, failov…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"51\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"487\" y2=\"200\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"56\" y=\"222\">05</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"492\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"end\">Live session</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"56\" y=\"240\">Runbooks and an on-call rota your team ca…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"56\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"492\" y2=\"246\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"43\" y=\"248\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"43\" y=\"248\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"61\" y=\"268\">06</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"497\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">Live register</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"61\" y=\"286\">Delivery metrics dashboard: lead time, de…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"61\" y1=\"292\" x2=\"497\" y2=\"292\"></line></g></svg><figcaption class=\"dg-capNote dg-stackCap\">All 6 artefacts of a Platform &amp; DevOps engagement, drawn in the order they arrive. Each is listed in full beside this.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Deliverables\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Infrastructure as code, reproducible from an empty account, in your repository</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>CI/CD pipeline with short-lived identity and automated rollback</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Service level objectives with error budgets and alerting that requires action</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Game day report covering rollback, failover and restore-from-backup</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Runbooks and an on-call rota your team can operate</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Delivery metrics dashboard: lead time, deploy frequency, change failure rate, restore time</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"outcomes\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Outcomes</p><h2 id=\"outcomes\" class=\"sv-h2\">What changes afterwards</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Outcomes\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Releases that do not depend on a specific person being available</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A rollback that has been executed, not just written down</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>No long-lived cloud credentials in continuous integration</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Alerts that page a human only when a human is needed</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Environments that differ by configuration rather than by archaeology</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"team\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Who does the work</p><h2 id=\"team\" class=\"sv-h2\">The team on your engagement</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">A platform lead and one or two engineers, with a cloud security reviewer at the identity and secrets gates.</p></div><div class=\"sv-expert\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Priya Raman\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;font-size:33px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(324 18% 22%), hsl(324 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">PR</span></div><div><h3 class=\"sv-expert__name\">Priya Raman</h3><p class=\"sv-expert__role\">Principal Architect</p><p class=\"sv-expert__bio\">Architects the business systems work — ERP, CRM and the platform engagements. Spent six years in manufacturing operations before writing software for it, which is why she asks to see the spreadsheets in week one.</p><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-expert__certs-label\" id=\"certs-priya-raman\">Certifications</p><ul class=\"sv-chips\" aria-labelledby=\"certs-priya-raman\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">AWS Solutions Architect Professional</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">CKA</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/about/leadership/priya-raman\">More about Priya Raman</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"reviews\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Third-party reviews</p><h2 id=\"reviews\" class=\"sv-h2\">Where we are reviewed</h2></div><ul class=\"sv-accred\" aria-label=\"Third-party reviews\"><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">Clutch — 4.9 from 31 reviews</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"https://clutch.co/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Read the reviews on Clutch</a></span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">G2 — 4.7 from 44 reviews</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"https://www.g2.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Read the reviews on G2</a></span></span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:var(--s12)\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s4)\">Accreditation</p><ul class=\"sv-accred\"><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information Security Management</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">UKAS-accredited certification body</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">ISO 9001:2015 — Quality Management</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">UKAS-accredited certification body</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">SOC 2 Type II — Security, Availability, Confidentiality</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">Independent CPA firm</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">Cyber Essentials Plus — audited technical controls</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">IASME, on behalf of the NCSC</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Every certificate number and expiry date is published</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/trust\">Our own security posture</a></p></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"clients\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"clients\" class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\">Selected clients</h2><div class=\"marquee\" style=\"--gap:var(--s12);--marquee-dur:52s\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><ul class=\"marquee__track mq-track\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Related</p><h2 id=\"related\" class=\"sv-h2\">What usually goes with this</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--2\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Cybersecurity</span></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Production systems with authorisation, audit and secrets handled properly from the first commit.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\">Secure SDLC</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">One firm, two practices, one backlog. The seam between build and break, removed.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Secure SDLC</span></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Cybersecurity</span></p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">See everything under Cybersecurity</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Commercials</p><h2 id=\"engagement\" class=\"sv-h2\">Shape, timeline and scoping</h2></div><dl class=\"sv-defs\"><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Timeline</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">12–16 weeks for a platform uplift, then advisory.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Team shape</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A platform lead and one or two engineers, with a cloud security reviewer at the identity and secrets gates.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Engagement</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">Project engagement with handover, or an embedded platform engineer.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Scoping</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.<!-- --> <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">How the four engagement models differ</a>.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Questions</p><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"sv-h2\">Frequently asked</h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do we need Kubernetes?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Probably not. Kubernetes is the right answer for many services, many teams and genuine multi-tenancy. For a handful of services and one team, a managed container runtime costs a fraction of the operational burden. We will tell you which case you are in during the assessment, and \\\"we already decided on Kubernetes\\\" is a fine answer too — we will just make it boring.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you measure improvement?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The four delivery metrics — lead time for change, deployment frequency, change failure rate, time to restore — baselined in week one. They are the only honest way to tell a platform improvement from a platform migration.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you do this without a platform freeze?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and we prefer to. The new pipeline runs in parallel, one service migrates, then the rest follow once it has survived a fortnight. A big-bang platform migration is the shape of engagement most likely to be abandoned halfway with two platforms to maintain.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What about cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cost shaping is part of the work: rightsizing, spot and savings commitments, storage lifecycle, and egress — which is the line item that surprises people. We report the saving against the baseline rather than claiming a percentage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is on call after you leave?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your team, with a rota we helped design and runbooks written from real incidents rather than from imagination. We can hold a secondary escalation during the first quarter if you want a safety net.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will your security practice review it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, at the identity and secrets gates, and a cloud security review at the end. The pipeline identity is where we most often find a path from a repository contributor to production.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"\"><div class=\"faq faq__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Do we need Kubernetes?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>How do you measure improvement?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can you do this without a platform freeze?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What about cost?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Who is on call after you leave?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Will your security practice review it?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><dl class=\"faq__nojs\"><div><dt>Do we need Kubernetes?</dt><dd>Probably not. Kubernetes is the right answer for many services, many teams and genuine multi-tenancy. For a handful of services and one team, a managed container runtime costs a fraction of the operational burden. We will tell you which case you are in during the assessment, and &quot;we already decided on Kubernetes&quot; is a fine answer too — we will just make it boring.</dd></div><div><dt>How do you measure improvement?</dt><dd>The four delivery metrics — lead time for change, deployment frequency, change failure rate, time to restore — baselined in week one. They are the only honest way to tell a platform improvement from a platform migration.</dd></div><div><dt>Can you do this without a platform freeze?</dt><dd>Yes, and we prefer to. The new pipeline runs in parallel, one service migrates, then the rest follow once it has survived a fortnight. A big-bang platform migration is the shape of engagement most likely to be abandoned halfway with two platforms to maintain.</dd></div><div><dt>What about cost?</dt><dd>Cost shaping is part of the work: rightsizing, spot and savings commitments, storage lifecycle, and egress — which is the line item that surprises people. We report the saving against the baseline rather than claiming a percentage.</dd></div><div><dt>Who is on call after you leave?</dt><dd>Your team, with a rota we helped design and runbooks written from real incidents rather than from imagination. We can hold a secondary escalation during the first quarter if you want a safety net.</dd></div><div><dt>Will your security practice review it?</dt><dd>Yes, at the identity and secrets gates, and a cloud security review at the end. The pipeline identity is where we most often find a path from a repository contributor to production.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"enquiry-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><p class=\"sv-note\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>A platform lead and one or two engineers, with a cloud security reviewer at the identity and secrets gates.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><form class=\"sv-form\" id=\"enquiry-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_ID_403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnTo\" value=\"/services/platform-engineering\"/><div id=\"enquiry-incomplete\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.</p></div><div id=\"enquiry-email\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>That email address did not look complete. Check it and send again.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-name\">Your name<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-name\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-email\">Business email<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-email\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"enq-email-help\" name=\"email\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-email-help\">We reply from a person, not a no-reply address.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-company\">Company<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-company\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-country\">Country<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-country\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"enq-country-help\" name=\"country\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-country-help\">Relevant for data residency and time zone.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-interest\">What is this about<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><select id=\"enq-interest\" name=\"interest\" class=\"sv-select\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"penetration-testing\">Penetration testing</option><option value=\"application-security\">Application security programme</option><option value=\"cloud-security\">Cloud security review</option><option value=\"grc-compliance\">SOC 2 / ISO 27001 / PCI DSS</option><option value=\"managed-detection-response\">Managed detection &amp; response</option><option value=\"red-teaming\">Red team</option><option value=\"vciso\">vCISO</option><option value=\"custom-software\">Custom software build</option><option value=\"web-application-development\">Web application</option><option value=\"platform-engineering\" selected=\"\">Platform &amp; DevOps</option><option value=\"business-systems\">ERP / CRM / HRM / LMS</option><option value=\"devsecops\">Secure SDLC — build and test together</option><option value=\"not-sure\">Not sure yet — help me work it out</option></select></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-message\">What are you trying to achieve, and what is the deadline<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"enq-message\" name=\"message\" class=\"sv-textarea\" rows=\"5\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-message-help\"></textarea><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-message-help\">Two or three sentences is plenty. The constraint is usually more useful than the requirement.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field sv-field--check\"><input id=\"enq-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sv-check\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-consent-help\" name=\"consent\"/><span><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-consent\">I agree to Envenox contacting me about this enquiry.<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-consent-help\">We keep enquiry details for 24 months from last contact and never share them. See the privacy notice.</p></span></div><p class=\"sv-help\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sv-req\">*</span> <!-- -->Required.</p><div class=\"sv-form__actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></button><p class=\"sv-form__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"light\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">Deployment that is boring, and a rollback somebody has actually rehearsed.</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">Project engagement with handover, or an embedded platform engineer.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"f