\\\"sv-def__term\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Team shape\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def__desc\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A platform lead and one or two engineers, with a cloud security reviewer at the identity and secrets gates.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dt\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def__term\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Engagement\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def__desc\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Project engagement with handover, or an embedded platform engineer.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dt\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def__term\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Scoping\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-def__desc\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Le\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/services/engagement-models\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How the four engagement models differ\\\"}],\\\".\\\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"37:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-section\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n.sec {\\\\n  position: relative;\\\\n  background-color: var(--bg);\\\\n  color: var(--fg);\\\\n}\\\\n/* Grain sits at z-index 1 with pointer-events none; content rides above it. */\\\\n.sec \\u003e .u-container,\\\\n.sec \\u003e .sec__bleed { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\\\\n\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\\\",\\\"data-theme-section\\\":\\\"light\\\",\\\"style\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"faq\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-container\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-head\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-head__rule\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"faq\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-h2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Frequently asked\\\"}],null]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L83\\\",null,{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Do we need Kubernetes?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Probably not. Kubernetes is the right answer for many services, many teams and genuine multi-tenancy. For a handful of services and one team, a managed container runtime costs a fraction of the operational burden. We will tell you which case you are in during the assessment, and \\\\\\\"we already decided on Kubernetes\\\\\\\" is a fine answer too — we will just make it boring.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How do you measure improvement?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The four delivery metrics — lead time for change, deployment frequency, change failure rate, time to restore — baselined in week one. They are the only honest way to tell a platform improvement from a platform migration.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can you do this without a platform freeze?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes, and we prefer to. The new pipeline runs in parallel, one service migrates, then the rest follow once it has survived a fortnight. A big-bang platform migration is the shape of engagement most likely to be abandoned halfway with two platforms to maintain.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What about cost?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Cost shaping is part of the work: rightsizing, spot and savings commitments, storage lifecycle, and egress — which is the line item that surprises people. We report the saving against the baseline rather than claiming a percentage.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Who is on call after you leave?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Your team, with a rota we helped design and runbooks written from real incidents rather than from imagination. We can hold a secondary escalation during the first quarter if you want a safety net.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Will your security practice review it?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes, at the identity and secrets gates, and a cloud security review at the end. The pipeline identity is where we most often find a path from a repository contributor to production.\\\"}],\\\"headingLevel\\\":3}]]}]}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"84:{\\\"id\\\":\\\"403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\\\",\\\"bound\\\":null}\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"38:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-section\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n.sec {\\\\n  position: relative;\\\\n  background-color: var(--bg);\\\\n  color: var(--fg);\\\\n}\\\\n/* Grain sits at z-index 1 with pointer-events none; content rides above it. */\\\\n.sec \\u003e .u-container,\\\\n.sec \\u003e .sec__bleed { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\\\\n\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section grain\\\",\\\"data-theme-section\\\":\\\"light\\\",\\\"style\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"enquiry-h2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-container\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-rail\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-rail__aside\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Get started\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"enquiry-h2\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-h2\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"marginTop\\\":\\\"var(--s3)\\\"},\\\"children\\\":\\\"Book a 60-minute scoping call\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-lede\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-note\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"xmlns\\\":\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\",\\\"width\\\":16,\\\"height\\\":16,\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":1.75,\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide lucide-users\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"display\\\":\\\"inline-block\\\",\\\"verticalAlign\\\":\\\"-3px\\\",\\\"marginRight\\\":\\\"var(--s2)\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"1yyitq\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"16gr8j\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"kshegd\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"circle\\\",\\\"nufk8\\\",{\\\"cx\\\":\\\"9\\\",\\\"cy\\\":\\\"7\\\",\\\"r\\\":\\\"4\\\"}],\\\"$undefined\\\"]}],\\\"A platform lead and one or two engineers, with a cloud security reviewer at the identity and secrets gates.\\\"]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-rail__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"form\\\",null,{\\\"action\\\":\\\"$h84\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-form\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"enquiry-form\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"input\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"hidden\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"returnTo\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"/services/platform-engineering\\\"}],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"enquiry-incomplete\\\",{\\\"id\\\":\\\"enquiry-incomplete\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-form__error\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"alert\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"enquiry