ign time — Before the first sprint. The cheapest security finding is an architecture decision, and the most expensive one is the same decision discovered in week forty.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Secure design review at each decision — Our testers review architectural decision records as they are written, not the finished system.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Secure design review at each decision — Our testers review architectural decision records as they are written, not the finished system.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gmf2c\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Monitoring and retest — Detections written for the system we built, and a retest cadence after launch. The loop does not stop at release.\",{\"as\":\"li\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$L9e\",\"$undefined\"]}],\"$L9f\"]}]]}]}]\n4f: